What was wrong and retracted: the coordinator's own relayed summaries overstated three numbers before the writer generated them (seeds knob bar "all four" → 3 of 4; NS ladder POD cheaper "at every rung" → 5 of 6; ns303 drop "about four-fold" → 3.3–4.4x); each is in the paper's ledger. The solve-layer statistic above.

